---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import site from '../site.config.ts';
import { url } from '../lib/url.ts';
---
<Page title="About" description="About Newspaper Front Page Maker, a free tool that makes a front page with your photo in your browser. See what it does, how it works and who made it.">
  <p>{site.name} is a free tool that makes a newspaper front page with your photo. You pick a layout, add a photo and change the words. Then you print it or post it.</p>
  <h2>Who it is for</h2>
  <p>People who want a fun gift for a birthday, an anniversary, a wedding, a retirement, a graduation or a new baby. Teachers and students who need a front page for a class project. Anyone who wants a light joke for the office or the group chat. It works on a phone or a computer.</p>
  <h2>How to use it</h2>
  <p>Choose an occasion and type the name. Pick a layout: classic broadsheet, tabloid or vintage. Add a photo. Tap any text on the page to change it. Then download a PNG or a PDF for Letter or A4 paper, or a size for social media.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>The page is drawn in your browser. Your photo is read on your device and is never uploaded or saved. The text you type is saved on your own device, so a reload does not lose it. We do not ask you to create an account. The layouts are our own designs and do not copy any real newspaper.</p>
  <h2>Who made this</h2>
  <p>This tool was built by <a href="https://bingemind.com/abhishek-mishra/">Abhishek Mishra</a>, a software development engineer (SDE) at Oqu AI, and is published by Bingemind.</p>
  <p>Phone and WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+916376068337">+91 63760 68337</a> (<a href="https://wa.me/916376068337" rel="noopener">message on WhatsApp</a>).</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or ideas? Write to <a href={site.contactHref}>{site.contactLabel}</a> or visit the <a href={url('/contact/')}>Contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
